# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data.  data/ is read-only inputs; cluster-output/ is everything generated.
# We DO version the small, hard-to-regenerate text inputs — the cleaned XYZ
# (xyz-files/, initial_xyz_files/) and precomputed FEFF spectra
# (calculated-spectra/).  We do NOT version the large, freely re-downloadable
# PDBs (pdb-files/, ~2 GB — repopulate with `zch-fetch-pdbs`), the generated
# analysis-and-visualization/ plots, or the cluster-output/ tree.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*/*
!data/*/xyz-files/
!data/*/initial_xyz_files/
!data/*/calculated-spectra/
cluster-output/

# Stray logs anywhere.
**/*.log

# query_app: the prebuilt db + cache + csv are checked in on purpose (they live
# alongside the app module at src/zn_cys_his/query_app/). Nothing to un-ignore
# here as long as data/ is the only ignored tree; listed for clarity.
!src/zn_cys_his/query_app/structures.db
!src/zn_cys_his/query_app/metadata_cache.json
!src/zn_cys_his/query_app/csv/
